==Description==
'''WOW''' is a sticker unlocked by reaching Level 14 of the premium track in the [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]]. At that Level, it cost {{Bunz|410}} or {{Robux|88}}. The total cost was {{Bunz|2,870}} or {{Robux|915}}.

==Appearance==
'''WOW''' contains the default [[Engineer]]'s head which has an amazed expression. A sound of someone saying wow can be heard when used.

